{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d9d6006945d280a8e5","chatId":"3d73a8ba67f54633b147d26633b60fa3","sessionId":null,"userId":69069,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":982,"promptTokens":1654,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:33"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009704337959023262,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d9d6006945d280a8e4","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369753143,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:33","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d9d6006945d280a8e4","chatId":"3d73a8ba67f54633b147d26633b60fa3","sessionId":null,"userId":69069,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n我申请了8所本科学校。每封录取决定信都会在不同的时候给到我。我等到所有的信都收到了，才一同打开他们。 开完所有信后，我发现其中5所大学，包括我的梦校，都把我拒了。不过发录取信的3所大学中有一所给了我全额奖学金。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，我最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 失望 & 自豪 & 绝望\nB) 气恼 & 失望 & 自豪\nC) 自豪 & 释怀 & 尴尬\nD) 失望 & 自豪 & 尴尬\nE) 失望 & 释怀 & 绝望\nF) 气恼 & 绝望 & 尴尬\n\n## 问题 2\n我为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 我被一些大学拒了，但是另外一所大学给了我全额奖学金 & 我被梦校拒绝了 & 我能进入一所给我全额奖学金的大学\nB) 我被一些大学拒了，但是另外一所大学给了我全额奖学金 & 我并不想从其他大学收到录取通知 & 我有一份非常好的简历\nC) 我被梦校拒绝了 & 我申请了大量的大学 & 我比招生团队更优秀\nD) 我同时收到了所有大学的决定信 & 我比招生团队更优秀 & 我被我梦想中的大学录取\nE) 我被梦校拒绝了 & 我被我梦想中的大学录取 & 我有一份非常好的简历\nF) 我被一些大学拒了，但是另外一所大学给了我全额奖学金 & 我收到了一所排名较低大学的录取通知 & 我收到了一封电子邮件而非电话","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009704337959023262,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d9d6006945d280a8e5","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369753141,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:33","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"bd94582450d1411a91bc0fd845c4a3b6"}